        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "An excellent place to feel welcome. The staff is so sweet and professional. My son had an accident at school where he needed to see the dentist. The staff was with us every step of the way even if they didn't need to be implicated. They went out of their way and made sure that my son was taken care of since they couldn't do his stitches.\n\nWe really can't thank them enough for everything they've done.\n\nBest dental place hands down.",
